/T (This reportdocuments EDA and preprocessing for the KC1 software defect prediction dataset. The supplied graphs indicate target-class imbalance, potential outliers in selected software metrics, strong correlations among some metrics, and a higher median cyclomatic complexity for defective modules. The substantial reduction in record count must be reconciled with the exact cleaning code. Missing-value status and preprocessing methods should be supported by numerical output. These steps provide a foundation for subsequent supervised learning, provided that the pipeline is reproducible and avoids data leakage. )
